| description = The Clerics of Tunare can be found in the [[High Elf]] city of [[Felwithe]].  The Paladins under the guidance of Guildmaster Tynkale can be found out front in a large hall, and around back a small hall is reserved for the Clerics under Guildmaster Yeolarn Bronzeleaf.  The members of this fine guild dedicated to the Mother of All, [[Tunare]], support The Elven [[King Tearis Thex]].  The Paladin Lord Jyleel is in charge of a secret elven order called the Koada'Vie and not all of their tasks would normally be associated with Paladins.

